{"line_id": "E37_lower_0000", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 0, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "我许久不见姐姐和莞姐姐在一起了，", "text_en": "I have not seen you and Wan together in a long time.", "text_en_tts": "I have not seen you and Wan together in a long time", "start_ms": 80, "end_ms": 2320, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0000.wav", "audio_sha256": "d635c873cdfab980686e469728f3847d5cac496012aa82ca17b674f26860142a", "reference_duration_ms": 2240.0, "reference_start_ms": 80, "reference_end_ms": 2320, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 0}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0001", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 1, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "这是怎么了？", "text_en": "What happened?", "text_en_tts": "What happened?", "start_ms": 2720, "end_ms": 3440, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0001.wav", "audio_sha256": "daffddf22c7c6ef9fc5ae3ca9be7eed5d4b26cb060ca6e5499039e5b5d1176d0", "reference_duration_ms": 720.0, "reference_start_ms": 2720, "reference_end_ms": 3440, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 1}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0002", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 2, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "皇上常去她那儿，我不便过去。", "text_en": "He is often with her, so I keep my distance.", "text_en_tts": "He is often with her, so I keep my distance", "start_ms": 5020, "end_ms": 7340, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0002.wav", "audio_sha256": "91abe27b2ac35fe406255ce0e83bfb1f463667b78e4bb6e4a40627f9b5cf07c9", "reference_duration_ms": 2320.0, "reference_start_ms": 5020, "reference_end_ms": 7340, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 2}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0003", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 3, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "又要忙着伺候太后，", "text_en": "and serving the Empress Dowager,", "text_en_tts": "and serving the Empress Dowager,", "start_ms": 7820, "end_ms": 9420, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0003.wav", "audio_sha256": "b9b60a8048615754bb8c011db03d2ae00ef55c7c41292ab9aca01fd81211dddf", "reference_duration_ms": 1600.0, "reference_start_ms": 7820, "reference_end_ms": 9420, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 3}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0004", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 4, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "是而碰不到了。", "text_en": "So we do not see each other.", "text_en_tts": "So we do not see each other", "start_ms": 9900, "end_ms": 10980, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0004.wav", "audio_sha256": "ee85e4827406728a05194f672135fdd6a16766691bc4cc47c5d8e7ac7cbb2393", "reference_duration_ms": 1080.0, "reference_start_ms": 9900, "reference_end_ms": 10980, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 4}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0005", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 5, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "那就好，", "text_en": "That is good.", "text_en_tts": "That is good", "start_ms": 11500, "end_ms": 12100, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0005.wav", "audio_sha256": "08f55ddc24735d6b8ade6000c89ccf92a42a6f78f444cdc26cc898734e37fffd", "reference_duration_ms": 600.0, "reference_start_ms": 11500, "reference_end_ms": 12100, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 5}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0006", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 6, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "原是我多心了。", "text_en": "I was [probably] worrying too much.", "text_en_tts": "I was probably worrying too much", "start_ms": 12740, "end_ms": 13860, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0006.wav", "audio_sha256": "7d515b41d55b5e83348eca8ef2de8847d81d27e2ec6c2a7d8815320e0aa36968", "reference_duration_ms": 1120.0, "reference_start_ms": 12740, "reference_end_ms": 13860, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 6}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0007", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 7, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "见姐姐和莞姐姐总不在一块。", "text_en": "I saw you and Wan were not together much.", "text_en_tts": "I saw you and Wan were not together much", "start_ms": 14420, "end_ms": 16220, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0007.wav", "audio_sha256": "e1fe7bdf1b747a2a44dbf9e566052a5d97d8a7943c35c8327e85bbe1bf3e0f65", "reference_duration_ms": 1800.0, "reference_start_ms": 14420, "reference_end_ms": 16220, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 7}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0008", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 8, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "还以为咱们姐妹生分了呢。", "text_en": "I thought we had grown [apart].", "text_en_tts": "I thought we had grown apart", "start_ms": 16950, "end_ms": 18590, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0008.wav", "audio_sha256": "b0c3fbeafe0972b9e00b96e6abcfc5c60633cd92643d1a1b894007e76db541ad", "reference_duration_ms": 1640.0, "reference_start_ms": 16950, "reference_end_ms": 18590, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 8}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0009", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 9, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "你怎会这么认为？", "text_en": "Why would you think that?", "text_en_tts": "Why would you think that?", "start_ms": 19390, "end_ms": 20710, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0009.wav", "audio_sha256": "6f0df164e416b838432e78b71ec186881a81479546b9ea8e3631b59f55374bc7", "reference_duration_ms": 1320.0, "reference_start_ms": 19390, "reference_end_ms": 20710, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 9}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0010", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 10, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "若是大家亲如姐妹，", "text_en": "If we are all close like sisters,", "text_en_tts": "If we are all close like sisters,", "start_ms": 21430, "end_ms": 23110, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0010.wav", "audio_sha256": "6a87ded74da2129412880f4c9d74462ff9c20c4369efb8605983238f18d95130", "reference_duration_ms": 1680.0, "reference_start_ms": 21430, "reference_end_ms": 23110, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 10}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0011", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 11, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "彼此坦诚相对，", "text_en": "and honest with each other,", "text_en_tts": "and honest with each other,", "start_ms": 23390, "end_ms": 24710, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0011.wav", "audio_sha256": "d284a7dfc63ad99e0a59de40789f4d5dd5ccb58045ae4b31cf77f2ef6ac8b898", "reference_duration_ms": 1320.0, "reference_start_ms": 23390, "reference_end_ms": 24710, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 11}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0012", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 12, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "又怎么会生分？", "text_en": "how could we grow apart?", "text_en_tts": "how could we grow apart?", "start_ms": 25270, "end_ms": 26390, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0012.wav", "audio_sha256": "854030308d7dddf11aaef82cc3a549c671d44279d21eb3550944cfe21d7955e1", "reference_duration_ms": 1120.0, "reference_start_ms": 25270, "reference_end_ms": 26390, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 12}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0013", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 13, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "原是妹妹多心，才问了这么一句，", "text_en": "I was just being oversensitive, so I asked.", "text_en_tts": "I was just being oversensitive, so I asked", "start_ms": 28070, "end_ms": 30510, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0013.wav", "audio_sha256": "441de761fb73c250ac0db69551747d5b80ccfdc97d33012345e0949a83552dc7", "reference_duration_ms": 2440.0, "reference_start_ms": 28070, "reference_end_ms": 30510, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 13}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0014", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 14, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "姐姐别见怪。", "text_en": "Please do not take offense.", "text_en_tts": "Please do not take offense", "start_ms": 31190, "end_ms": 32150, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0014.wav", "audio_sha256": "3095c3a4bf57e3bdefd0d750cea8bf6ca207f7ba46097e1df119a322d6528ec9", "reference_duration_ms": 960.0, "reference_start_ms": 31190, "reference_end_ms": 32150, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 14}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0015", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 15, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "你爱多心，我又不是第一日才知道，", "text_en": "You always overthink. I have known that for a long time.", "text_en_tts": "You always overthink. I have known that for a long time", "start_ms": 33270, "end_ms": 36230, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0015.wav", "audio_sha256": "46dc81eb5ce33902f3605a65ad918a6c9cba1fed48290dd1db788ace841a102a", "reference_duration_ms": 2960.0, "reference_start_ms": 33270, "reference_end_ms": 36230, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 15}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0016", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 16, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "否则", "text_en": "Otherwise,", "text_en_tts": "Otherwise,", "start_ms": 36950, "end_ms": 37390, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0016.wav", "audio_sha256": "169ec91b684a50ea5d0fb2185a06c638110a003e123b925037282e7d561e1bdc", "reference_duration_ms": 500.0, "reference_start_ms": 36920, "reference_end_ms": 37420, "reference_window_source": "Existing workflow.log expansion entry", "reference_text_needs_review": true, "reference_text_review_reason": "The source workflow expanded a short reference window to 500 ms; adjacent speech may not be covered by text_zh.", "source_dialogue_index": 16}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0017", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 17, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "也不会巴巴地跑来告诉我，", "text_en": "you would not have rushed over to tell me", "text_en_tts": "you would not have rushed over to tell me", "start_ms": 37750, "end_ms": 39550, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0017.wav", "audio_sha256": "e3c9a10e05e60586ddaf9a30daea6a6ba9490f365d2624bef2d5b5cd0deac5f0", "reference_duration_ms": 1800.0, "reference_start_ms": 37750, "reference_end_ms": 39550, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 17}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0018", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 18, "speaker": "沈眉庄", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_002", "text_zh": "莞嫔劝皇上复位华妃的事。", "text_en": "that Wan urged the Emperor to bring back Consort Hua.", "text_en_tts": "that Wan urged the Emperor to bring back Consort Hua", "start_ms": 39950, "end_ms": 42190, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/沈眉庄/line_0018.wav", "audio_sha256": "2dd8a49ba3e387adf36f61516344f7f9af805ab8882148b93e091df23ac76a51", "reference_duration_ms": 2240.0, "reference_start_ms": 39950, "reference_end_ms": 42190, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 18}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0019", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 19, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "关心则乱，", "text_en": "Concern clouds judgment.", "text_en_tts": "Concern clouds judgment", "start_ms": 43450, "end_ms": 44250, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0019.wav", "audio_sha256": "00f4017ece60e93aae66153df9e20bfb32c25cdd8ed445f29c0fb7cff719a4b7", "reference_duration_ms": 800.0, "reference_start_ms": 43450, "reference_end_ms": 44250, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 19}
{"line_id": "E37_lower_0020", "unit_id": "E37_lower", "line_index": 20, "speaker": "安陵容", "speaker_id": "E37_lower:char_001", "text_zh": "我也是担心两位姐姐。", "text_en": "I was just worried about you both.", "text_en_tts": "I was just worried about you both", "start_ms": 44770, "end_ms": 46250, "audio_path": "E37_lower/audio/安陵容/line_0020.wav", "audio_sha256": "9d29594118a4ad9195c9b79661df91f7fd7fc304b763ace6d89a05653aeb2d99", "reference_duration_ms": 1480.0, "reference_start_ms": 44770, "reference_end_ms": 46250, "reference_window_source": "Source dialogue timestamps; verified against WAV frame count", "reference_text_needs_review": false, "reference_text_review_reason": null, "source_dialogue_index": 20}
